Sanitization notes
------------------
- The dropbear child-connection line (quoting the guest-side forwarded address) is
  deliberately excluded from this excerpt.
- No credentials, no host paths, no firmware/NAND content: this file contains only
  console lines already produced by the guest plus provenance.
- Guest wall-clock shows "Jan 1 03:0x" (no RTC in the emulated board), as in all
  prior cycles on this stand.
